      "description": "内部者の裏切り。罪の投影と自己正当化。",
      "gh:callsign": "LEDGER",
      "gh:persona": "二重帳簿の術者",
      "gh:ghost": { "@id": "ghost:ledger-thief" }
    },
    {
      "@id": "ghost:ledger-thief",
